@V := "tape" :: spec [active]
  version = "1.0"

@H 1166 := "live-engine adaptation curve — drive the LIVE CORE engine (engine_mitosis_tick + pure_field_step) over a non-stationary stream and measure whether the engine's own error/tension FALLS as it adapts (p8), confirming the toy H_1159 ON-beats-OFF advantage on the REAL substrate (not just cell-count growth)" :: discovery [⏳ NO-ADAPTATION-SIGNAL — honest, the falsifier's ⏳ branch (a_paper_negative_ok)]
  domain     = "MITOSIS-ENGINE · Next rung #1 (the live-engine adaptation curve)"
  seed       = "H_1159 🟢 (toy k-means split, err 13.03→1.64) + H_1159b 🟢 (toy capacity self-tune) proxied inference-time mitosis with a TOY numpy clustering split, NOT the live engine. Open rung: does the LIVE CORE engine show the SAME adaptation ADVANTAGE — error/tension falling as new regimes appear — on the real substrate, p8 NO TRAIN/INFER SPLIT?"
  arms       = "LIVE engine driven over a non-stationary stream (N=600, K=5 regimes appearing over time, novelty 1→5), mitosis ON (engine_cli_parse --mitosis on) vs OFF (--no-mitosis), IDENTICAL stream; per-step LIVE pure_field_step + LIVE engine_mitosis_tick; adaptation metric = engine's OWN coherence-error = 1 − pure_field.narrative_coherence, late-window (2nd half) mean"
  falsifier  = "🟢 LIVE-ADAPTS iff ON adaptation-error NON-RISING while OFF RISES, Cohen's d≥0.8 (ON beats OFF) — confirms H_1159 live · 🔴 if ON ties/loses to OFF (toy↔live mismatch) · ⏳ if the live engine exposes NO usable adaptation/error signal to measure (note what's missing)"
  result     = "⏳ NO-ADAPTATION-SIGNAL (deterministic, 3 seeds 7/8/9, $0 CPU 0-pod, g5/p7, live CORE). The live engine_mitosis_tick FIRES correctly — cells ON 3→603 vs OFF static 3 (growth sanity TRUE) — but the engine's coherence-error is BYTE-IDENTICAL ON vs OFF on every seed (late_err 3.51053e-10 both arms, ON−OFF diff=0.0, Cohen's d=0.0). No adaptation signal moves with mitosis."
  why        = "pure_field_step (CORE/pure_field.hexa) is a ZERO-INPUT internal-oscillator loop — it advances fast/medium/slow oscillators ONLY and IGNORES the stream sample; AND engine_mitosis_tick's cell_count is NEVER fed back into pure_field. So the Φ/coherence trajectory is determined by the oscillators alone and is provably identical whether mitosis is ON or OFF. The toy H_1159 clustering-reconstruction-error (distance to nearest prototype cell) has NO live counterpart: the cell-count → field → error coupling is UNBUILT (a_core_engine_map — anchors/inputs enter via named slots; the field step has no input/error port yet)."
  finding    = "The live CORE engine GROWS cells under mitosis (H_1159b capacity confirmed live) but exposes NO error/tension metric coupled to either the input stream OR the mitosis cell count, so the H_1159 ADAPTATION advantage (error falls ON, rises OFF) cannot be adjudicated live. This is the falsifier's stated ⏳ branch — honestly distinguished from 🔴 (which would require a real ON-vs-OFF error signal that ties): there is no live error signal AT ALL. The toy↔live confirmation of the ADAPTATION claim is BLOCKED on unbuilt wiring (stream→field input port + cell_count→field feedback + a reconstruction/tension-error readout), NOT on a measured live mismatch. H_1159b's capacity-tracks-complexity leg DID transfer live (cell growth fires); the H_1159 error-adaptation leg did not (no error surface)."
  guard      = "READ-ONLY probe — imports + CALLS pure_field_step / engine_mitosis_tick / engine_cli_parse, modifies NO engine file. engine_cli_smoke.hexa re-run AFTER the probe = 12 pass / 0 fail (the 12/12 anchor unbroken)."
  honest     = "toy non-stationary stream, live CORE engine-sim (NOT AKIDA/byte-LM), $0 CPU 0-pod deterministic. The ⏳ is a property of TODAY's wiring (a_core_engine_map: field step input/error port + mitosis→field feedback both unbuilt), NOT a claim that live adaptation is impossible — it would need those 3 wires + a reconstruction/tension-error readout, then H_1159's frozen ON-vs-OFF falsifier re-runs unchanged. scale UNVERIFIED (a_scale_honest_scope)."
  harness    = "CORE/h1166_live_adaptation_probe.hexa · .verdicts/1166_live_adaptation/H_1166.txt"
  xref       = "p8 · 1159_inference_time_mitosis_learning · 1159b (capacity self-tune) · a_core_engine_map · a_paper_negative_ok · a_scale_honest_scope · p7 · engine_cli.hexa engine_mitosis_tick · pure_field.hexa pure_field_step"
  target     = "🟢 LIVE-ADAPTS (confirm H_1159 live) · 🔴 toy↔live mismatch · ⏳ NO-SIGNAL (REACHED — unbuilt coupling)"
